@SolTTS.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Streaming speech synthesis (play directly with ffplay)
# Run in PowerShell: ffplay.exe -f f32le -ar 32000 -window_title "SolTTS Stream" -nodisp "http://localhost:5000/api/tts/predict-stream?text=良宵方始，不必心急。"
GET {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/predict-stream?text=良宵方始，不必心急。&speed=1.0

### Create a streaming synthesis session
POST {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/stream/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "良宵方始，不必心急。",
  "speed": 1.0,
  "noiseScale": 0.35,
  "temperature": 1.0,
  "topK": 15
}

### Fetch streaming audio data (using the sessionId above)
GET {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/stream/{sessionId}

### Cancel a streaming synthesis session
DELETE {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/stream/{sessionId}

### Get all active streaming sessions
GET {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/stream/sessions

### Full speech synthesis
POST {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "测试全量语音合成功能"
}

### Get the voice list
GET {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/avatars

### Hot-reload configuration
POST {{SolTTS.Web_HostAddress}}/api/tts/reload

